---
---

<section class="bento-section section reveal" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="bento-header reveal delay-100">
      <h2 class="section-title">A complete <span class="accent-text">Zero-Trust</span> architecture.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">We didn't just build a Git alias. We built a fail-closed orchestration engine that guarantees your identity never leaks.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-grid">
      
      <!-- Card 1: The Boundary (2x2) -->
      <div class="bento-card span-2x2 reveal delay-200">
        <div class="bento-visual card-1-visual">
          <div class="lock-icon">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="config-lines">
            <div class="line w-3/4"></div>
            <div class="line w-1/2"></div>
            <div class="line w-full"></div>
            <div class="line w-5/6"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bento-content">
          <h3>The File Boundary</h3>
          <p>GitSetu isolates your <code>~/.ssh/config</code> and <code>.gitconfig</code> into dedicated, sandboxed profiles. It uses native Git <code>includeIf</code> directives to hot-swap them instantly based on your current working directory. Your personal keys are literally invisible when you are in your work directory.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Identity Guard (2x1) -->
      <div class="bento-card span-2x1 reveal delay-300">
        <div class="bento-visual card-2-visual">
          <div class="fake-terminal">
            <div class="term-text"><span class="prompt">~ ❯</span> git commit</div>
            <div class="term-text error">⚠ Identity mismatch detected!</div>
            <div class="term-text error">Commit blocked.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bento-content">
          <h3>Pre-Commit Guard</h3>
          <p>A fail-closed hook that physically blocks commits if your active email doesn't strictly match the profile.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Performance (1x1) -->
      <div class="bento-card span-1x1 reveal delay-100">
        <div class="bento-visual metric-visual">
          <span class="metric-value">&lt; 2<span class="metric-unit">ms</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="bento-content">
          <h3>Zero Latency</h3>
          <p>Written in pure Bash 3.2. Execution is completely imperceptible.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Keychain (1x1) -->
      <div class="bento-card span-1x1 reveal delay-200">
        <div class="bento-visual icon-visual">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accent-icon"><path d="M21 2l-2 2m-7.61 7.61a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-7.778 7.778 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.777-7.777zm0 0L15.5 7.5m0 0l3 3L22 7l-3-3m-3.5 3.5L19 4"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="bento-content">
          <h3>Hardware FIDO2</h3>
          <p>Natively bootsrap YubiKeys (<code>ed25519-sk</code>) out of the box.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Auto-Updater (3x1) -->
      <div class="bento-card span-3x1 reveal delay-300">
        <div class="bento-content horizontal">
          <div class="text-group">
            <h3>Atomic Auto-Updater</h3>
            <p>GitSetu heals itself. It checks for background updates via GitHub API and performs atomic, lock-based filesystem swaps so it never crashes mid-update.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="visual-group">
            <div class="progress-bar">
              <div class="progress-fill"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-text">Updating to v1.1.0... <span class="success-text">Done</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bento-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
  }

  .bento-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-auto-rows: minmax(220px, auto);
    gap: var(--space-md);
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .bento-card {
    background: var(--bg-code);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
  }

  .bento-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* Hover glow effect (pseudoelement) */
  .bento-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(800px circle at var(--mouse-x, 50%) var(--mouse-y, 50%), rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.06), transparent 40%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-base);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .bento-card:hover::after {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* Grid Spanning */
  .span-2x2 {
    grid-column: span 2;
    grid-row: span 2;
  }

  .span-2x1 {
    grid-column: span 2;
    grid-row: span 1;
  }

  .span-1x1 {
    grid-column: span 1;
    grid-row: span 1;
  }

  .span-3x1 {
    grid-column: span 3;
    grid-row: span 1;
  }

  /* Content Inner */
  .bento-content {
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl);
    flex-grow: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .bento-content h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .bento-content p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .bento-content code {
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  /* Visuals Area */
  .bento-visual {
    flex-grow: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Card 1 Visual: Lock & Config */
  .card-1-visual {
    min-height: 240px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }
  
  .lock-icon {
    position: absolute;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    z-index: 2;
    background: var(--bg-code);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
  }

  .config-lines {
    width: 80%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
  .line { height: 6px; background: var(--text-muted); border-radius: 3px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .w-3\/4 { width: 75%; }
  .w-1\/2 { width: 50%; }
  .w-full { width: 100%; }
  .w-5\/6 { width: 83%; }

  /* Card 2 Visual: Terminal Error */
  .card-2-visual {
    min-height: 140px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .fake-terminal {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    width: 100%;
  }
  .fake-terminal .prompt { color: var(--accent-primary); margin-right: 8px; }
  .fake-terminal .error { color: var(--color-error); margin-top: 8px; font-weight: 500; }

  /* Metric Visual */
  .metric-visual {
    min-height: 120px;
  }
  .metric-value {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }
  .metric-unit {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  /* Icon Visual */
  .icon-visual {
    min-height: 120px;
  }
  .accent-icon {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
  }

  /* Horizontal Layout (Card 5) */
  .horizontal {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .text-group { flex: 1; }
  .visual-group { flex: 1; width: 100%; }

  .progress-bar {
    width: 100%;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .progress-fill {
    width: 60%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--gradient-accent);
    border-radius: 4px;
    animation: load 2s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  .progress-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .success-text { color: var(--color-success); margin-left: 8px; }

  @keyframes load {
    0% { width: 10%; }
    100% { width: 100%; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .span-2x2, .span-3x1 {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .span-2x2, .span-2x1, .span-3x1, .span-1x1 {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }
    .horizontal {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
  }
</style>
